11
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:46,000
Him is a 2025 American supernatural horror film
co-written and directed by Justin Tipping.

12
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:06,000
The film stars Marlon Wayans, Tyriq Withers, Julia
Fox, Tim Heidecker, and Jim Jefferies.

13
01:09:20,000 --> 01:09:26,000
Its plot follows a young up-and-coming football player (Withers) training at the
isolated compound of an aging, nearly retired quarterback (Wayans).

14
01:14:40,000 --> 01:14:46,000
Him was released in the United States on September
19, 2025, by Universal Pictures.

15
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
It received generally negative reviews from critics and grossed
$28 million against a budget of $27 million.

16
01:25:20,000 --> 01:25:26,000
The film explores themes of ritual, cult, training, religion, injury.

17
01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:46,000
The tone is dark and mind_bending.
